%% Per-curve construction. Shape carries meaning: lean-r is input, subproc a
%% QuantLib object, hex a solve, win-pane an in-memory curve, doc an output,
%% diamond a branch. Dashed notes say why a branch exists at all.
flowchart TB
  Q@{ shape: lean-r, label: "quote<br/><small>rate · tenor · instrument</small>" } --> T{"instrument<br/>type"}
  T -->|DEPOSIT| H1@{ shape: subproc, label: "DualCurveDepositRateHelper" }
  T -->|OIS| H2@{ shape: subproc, label: "OISRateHelper" }
  T -->|MTG_OIS / IMM_OIS| H3@{ shape: subproc, label: "DatedOISRateHelper<br/><small>explicit start and end dates</small>" }
  T -->|FUTURE| H4@{ shape: subproc, label: "FuturesRateHelper" }
  T -->|FRA| H5@{ shape: subproc, label: "FraRateHelper" }
  T -->|IRS| H6@{ shape: subproc, label: "SwapRateHelper<br/><small>dual-curve: project / discount</small>" }
  T -->|FXSWAP / XCCY| H7@{ shape: subproc, label: "FxSwapRateHelper<br/>CrossCurrencyBasisSwapRateHelper" }

  H1 & H2 & H3 & H4 & H5 & H6 & H7 --> S{"short_end_step<br/>set?"}

  S -->|no| G@{ shape: hex, label: "PiecewiseYieldCurve<br/>Discount · LogCubic · GlobalBootstrap" }

  S -->|yes| A1@{ shape: hex, label: "stage 1 · strip only<br/>ForwardRate · BackwardFlat" }
  A1 --> A2@{ shape: subproc, label: "zero at each strip date<br/>becomes ZeroPinHelper" }
  A2 --> A3@{ shape: hex, label: "stage 2 · pins + long instruments<br/>ZeroYield · Cubic · GlobalBootstrap" }
  A3 --> A4@{ shape: win-pane, label: "StepSplineCurve composite<br/><small>stage 1 below tCut, stage 2 above</small>" }

  G --> C@{ shape: win-pane, label: "calibrated term structure" }
  A4 --> C
  C --> X@{ shape: doc, label: "pillar dates, times, zeros" }

  N1["staircase is correct here:<br/>the overnight rate is expected to be<br/>constant between policy meetings"] -.-> A1
  N2["log discount factors, not zeros:<br/>f = g′ is C¹ · on zeros f = z + t·z′<br/>picks up t·z‴ and rings at every knot"] -.-> G

  classDef note fill:none,stroke-dasharray:3 3
  class N1,N2 note
